Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, you have proven\Nyourselves among the elite!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we, the Academy Knights, welcome you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know, I am the captain\Nof said knights, Loretta Kugrit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some of you already know\Nmy younger sister, Loretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She happens to be a\Nfirst-year like yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one half of\NMiskler's minibus squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is a minibus?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the vice-captain, Lambert\NAurousseau, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Lambert here is Lene's elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dive right into our first\Norder of business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Planning the Foundation Day Fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old FDF, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly are we knights\Ngoing to do for the big day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we typically run a\Ncafe and serve customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be knights in dining armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I have to touch people's dirty\Nplates like some common servant girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am literally going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A regular cafe does sound a little boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could add some kind of theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never a good sign\Nwhen he gets creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cafe does not need a theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.26,0:01:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any suggestions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we could go basic and\Ndo a maid cafe or a butler cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except there's nothing novel about\Nhaving a servant in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have no interest in sexy butlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I would like to see Miss\NClaire in a butler's uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now there's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we draw people in with a gimmick\Nwhere the guys and girls swap styles?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, when you say styles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you mean the ladies will dress\Nas butlers and we'll dress as maids?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.01,0:01:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same basic cafe that we all know and\Nlove, but with a delightfully quirky twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your vision,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but would it be acceptable for\Nroyals to participate in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would it be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where do I even begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Rod's keen on the idea,\Nso let's let him have this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you support this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to experiment\Nwith dressing up as a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:01:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Prince Hugh votes yes,\Nthen I do too. Misha?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire in men's clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I support you too, Prince Rai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do not get a vote,\Nyou lascivious creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known you'd do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think that Prince Thane would\Nlook adorable in a frilly maid uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine the magnificence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 100 % against this idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voting has been closed, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then our festival project for this year\Nis officially a cross-dressing cafe!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.59,0:02:41.88,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.85,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.01,0:02:47.81,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.99,0:02:53.95,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. No, I'm a pride.\NWhat you want? Say it again
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.95,0:02:56.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.98,0:03:00.00,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want, only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.00,0:03:02.32,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know, you're a fool?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.32,0:03:06.21,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, you're a fool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.21,0:03:08.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.70,0:03:10.33,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, you're a fool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool, you're a fool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.17,0:03:14.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.09,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.09,0:03:20.59,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're a fool, you're a fool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.78,0:03:23.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.\NYou won't believe you!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.18,0:03:26.60,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you won't believe me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.81,0:03:28.47,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you, you won't believe me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.47,0:03:34.71,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you, it's not an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll raise your hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.35,0:03:37.32,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the joy of happiness is equal.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.32,0:03:41.11,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.11,0:03:46.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret is just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come from the heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.95,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand, let's do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.95,0:03:50.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.70,0:03:54.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hands, if you're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, more i-kai!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.79,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.79,0:03:59.42,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rei-chan-han, i-i-se-kai!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.42,0:04:03.30,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up until I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you! I love you!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.30,0:04:06.14,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
