Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to voice my opposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being such a\Ngood friend to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene has spoken very highly\Nof you as well, Ray Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master Lambert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that you're a\Npretty good egg yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard of him before today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the magic tool specialist\Nwho takes care of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Academy's maintenance and\Ninspection single-handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a renowned inventor,\Ntoo. Right, Master Lambert?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything all that special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wondered if I might\Nask a favor of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been noticing a lot more\Nconflicts between students recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some of the commoners have been\Nbehaving strangely as of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a number of small fights\Nhave broken out because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, how unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain and I have had our hands\Nfull dealing with the altercations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping you could investigate\Nsome other matters for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what the occasion,\NI shall rise to it flawlessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly appreciate it. Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the other matters\Nyou need help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, rumor has\Nit campus is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some students have reported seeing a\Nsuspicious figure wandering the halls at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some see it in the stairway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the students who were on night\Npatrol attempted to approach the figure
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later on a wet spot in the shape of a\Nhandprint was discovered on their shoulders
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why Miss Claire you're looking\Na little pale over there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're afraid\Nof not another word you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear nothing. Do you\Nhear me? Oh, it seems I've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit a sore spot would you\Nprefer to do a different task?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we've got cafe prep to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the kitchen is full of coolies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that might be out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, so far, there have\Nonly been sightings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't damaged anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just cover our eyes\Nif we see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the Knight's solemn duty to\Nprotect the Academy's students!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be wrong to ignore any\Ndisturbance, however trivial!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are you saying, Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am saying, let the vile specter come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall be the most noble ghost\Nhunter this world has ever known!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is how my spooktacular\Nevening with Ms. Claire began.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target location has been reached.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go scope out the\Nprep room in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you stay here where it's\Nlight and keep a lookout?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really just get\Nme an order, commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can go to the back room if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I shall let it go this time, but\Ndon't you dare let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's bust a ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ghosts are real ghosts are not real
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those foolish students\Nmust have been half asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, my hand is covered in goop. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like some kind of gelatin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I been attacked by a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably nothing to worry about, but\Nwe'll send it in for analysis to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was covered in something sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine with some soap and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just hang out here\Nuntil I finish exploring the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those presumptuous\Nacademy knights forcing me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to spend the night here\Nlike a scullery maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if ghosts are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if there's one here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is good fondant au chocolat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sort of like a chocolate\Ncake, but better and gooier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where on earth did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really expect me to believe you managed\Nto acquire a cake made from chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brumet's exclusive new confection?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get bogged down in the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you could just take a bite\Nand tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I'm not easily\Nimpressed, but I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cake is so rich in chocolate flavor,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and more chocolate oozes\Nout with every bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, it's positively heavenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, I must meet the\Npatissier who concocted this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you made this cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been coming up with all kinds of\Nscrumptious recipes to make for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you find time\Nto fiddle about in the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kitchen when you're always at my service?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a suspicious figure that\Nshows up night after night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wandering the halls, haunting the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ghost we've been hunting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I spooky enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me\Ninstead of letting me suffer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to surprise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dede!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.13,0:09:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made his food in a\Nnice cozy spot to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been planning it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you only bring one cot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:09:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a slumber party!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have taken a\Nturn for the ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving as soon as I finish my cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're really not gonna\Nspend the night with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've already solved the\Nmystery of the fake ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.97,0:10:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, um, what about\Nthe handprints, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I genuinely don't know\Nwhere they came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough games!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't fall for your tricks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding, though. Oh, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to my\Nroom! Wait! Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assistant, go save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ray Lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Ray Lair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doing, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you follow me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the handprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long that was... her? Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray Lair's on a transforming kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am done. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, we were gonna cuddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, does this mean you're not leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have, but I'm exhausted\Nfrom all your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you getting in or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you scoot a little closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Touch me, and I will smother\Nyou in your sleep! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stay on the side!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to sleep by myself tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:11:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so frightened!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but your mother\Nwon't be returning home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Master is still\Nbusy with work, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Father have to\Nstay with me always!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, my love, but it's\Npast time for us to be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's my birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so important that\Nyou have to leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show your mother some grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As nobles, we must put our\Nduties before all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but you always tell me to be\Npatient when you leave, and I have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've become really good at it, so\NI thought maybe just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll make this up to you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a special birthday present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can choose whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate you! Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Melia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A very happy birthday to you, Ms. Clare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May there be many more to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all work together to\Npick something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's pretty, but I\Nthink it might be too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me to use right now\Nyou may need some time to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grow into it but until\Nthat happens I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might be nice if you used\Nit to brush Lady Melia's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.32,0:14:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we sit down to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms. Claire! Ms. Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have terrible news, Ms. Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your parents were in a carriage accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Melia, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, you should try\Nto at least eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that you'll get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I die, I'll\Nget to see Mother again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Melia would be so\Nsad if she heard you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before she left, I told my\Nmother that I hated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were fighting, and that was\Nthe last thing I ever said to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get to tell her that I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I talked with Master\NLambert for a bit yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a stand-up gent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind and reliable and very humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though he's super talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And did you know, along with\Nhis magic tool research,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's also learning how\Nmonsters become familiars?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made him vice-captain\Nbecause of how...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm so proud\Nto call him my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, who wouldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, would you mind helping us with\Nprep for the Foundation Day Fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think Master Lambert\Nwould appreciate it. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this looks quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the top pick for our\Nmenu at the Foundation Day Fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, go on and taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This flavor, it tastes familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be mayonnaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the new sauce that was\Njust released by Brumet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on the mail, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Broom, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you get something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, uh, I heard about it\Nand then tried making my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try these ones next, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using limited ingredients\Nreally makes the meat stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I must admit, you're quite\Nthe chef for a lowly commoner. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, may I ask you something? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be the one supplying\Nall of these new recipes to Brumet now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the whole mayonnaise thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's next to impossible to guess a\Nrecipe like that after hearing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ingredients, the texture, the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would it take a culinary\Ngenius to get them all just right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, oh, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bothering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.80,0:18:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the meat, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is rare meat on sandwiches a\NBroumet innovation as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that wasn't just rare meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually called rosé, and it looks\Nlike that because the myoglobin is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caught by a true foodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well spill some of the beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've secretly been giving my recipes\Nto Brumet to put on their menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's common sense to utilize skills\Nfrom a previous life to turn a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broumet is the only upscale restaurant\Nin this country, so the payoff was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:19:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun fact, chocolate was the\Nfirst recipe I sold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, promise me that you'll\Nkeep this between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being the Taliban, Brumet's\Nmenu is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you all the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.88,0:19:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just know it's for Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just please don't tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we all have a few\Nsecrets, don't we, Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in return, will you promise\Nto teach me one of your recipes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to make something\Ngood for Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, meet me here again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you decided to bring\NMiss Claire with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I interrupt your secret club?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two are planning to make\Nsomething, then you are in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lend you my palate as a taste tester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.01,0:19:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to tell her anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing I can do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's chilly at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us know if you need something heavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and cook something. Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight we have the crème brûlée.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really outdone\Nyourself this time, Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even richer than regular custard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The caramelized sugar on top is exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind getting me some tea, Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, is this a recipe for mammoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Memorize it, and then ditch the note.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just really want you to have\Nthis, in case you ever need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will need to sample this\Nagain. What? You want another?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, that's a lot of sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd recommend whipping up another\Nbatch for practice anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just burn myself a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, you're quite the healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two seem awfully close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Miss Clara, are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:22:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think I'd be\Njealous of, you impertinent insect?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On days like this, I'm reminded that even\Nwhen nothing major happens, I'm so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish this happiness\Ncould last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
