Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.93,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I'm head over heels for you,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.93,0:23:15.14,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}And I'd rather just be honest:
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.81,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I can't help but love you -
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.81,0:23:17.98,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}And I'm not embarrassed at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.98,0:23:21.03,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I don't want to be hurt,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.03,0:23:22.11,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If we can't be together,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.11,0:23:25.61,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Then there's only one thing I want to do!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.80,0:23:31.76,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.76,0:23:35.73,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Someone who I could never meet in my world
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.73,0:23:39.73,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}As we grow close to each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.73,0:23:44.65,ed_eng_06_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}My feelings keep growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to read this. Be\Ndelicious. Be delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, love. Squee, squee. I love you. Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:23:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.30,0:24:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've\Nall been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.36,0:24:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Foundation Day Fair!
